 r←Test_Input_DataType_007(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;globalParms;parms;month;values;colors;Okay
⍝ Exercise "Input" with data type "Radio" with a "OnOK" callback.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 7⍴''
 colors←'Colors⋄Blue⋄Black⋄Yellow⋄Green⋄Pink⋄Margenta'
 defMat⍪←'Radios'colors 0 DT.Radio 0 1 1

 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
 0 ∆Process n.∆Form

 n.Radios_01 ∆KeyPress⊂'DC'
 n.Radios_02 ∆KeyPress⊂'DC'
 0 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕NQ n.∆OK'Select'
 0 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →FailsIf 0 0 0 1 0 0≢1⊃n.∆result[n.∆result[;0]⍳⊂'Radios';]

 r←∆OK
